      "bbox": {
        "l": 62.2297,
        "t": 353.76099999999997,
        "r": 422.3014999999997,
        "b": 341.584
      },
      "content": "Operate the safety valve by unscrewing the cap one or two turns and retighten it."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0992",
      "reading_order": 1415,
      "section": "Testing",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 28.21,
        "t": 324.33489999999995,
        "r": 66.43169999999998,
        "b": 312.0589
      },
      "content": "Testing",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0993",
      "reading_order": 1416,
      "section": "Testing",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 62.2297,
        "t": 304.9803999999999,
        "r": 319.46689999999967,
        "b": 273.6029000000001
      },
      "content": "Before removing the valve, depressurise the compressor. See section Problem solving."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0994",
      "reading_order": 1417,
      "section": "Testing",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 62.2297,
        "t": 265.5597,
        "r": 519.7482999999993,
        "b": 240.18270000000007
      },
      "content": "Valve (SV) can be tested on a separate air line. If the valve does not open at the set pressure stamped on the valve, it needs to be replaced."
    },
    {
